OL,3,GNEWSALib Dems' Ed Davey questioned on
OL,4,ABrexit, bin strikes, and small boats on
OL,5,ABBC local radio
OL,6,
OL,7,FDavey is being interviewed live on
OL,8,Fseven stations across England - it's
OL,9,FBBC Radio Somerset now
OL,11,FEarlier, he discussed the local council
OL,12,Fon BBC Radio Shropshire; bin strikes on
OL,13,FBBC Radio WM; and migrant crossings on
OL,14,FBBC Radio Kent
